cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below and link to https://prismaticalgos.com."
type: dataset
title: "State of Retail Trading Algorithms 2026"
abstract: >-
  Aggregate statistics from a review of 12,715 publicly documented retail
  trading algorithms: strategy-family distribution, technical-indicator
  crowding, documented risk-control gaps (stop-loss, take-profit, position
  sizing, unbounded grid/martingale) and evidence quality (Sharpe reporting,
  sample size, out-of-sample testing).
authors:
  - name: "Prismatic Algos"
    website: "https://prismaticalgos.com"
